 305:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c **** /**
 306:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****    * @brief  Update SystemCoreClock variable according to Clock Register Values.
 307:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *         The SystemCoreClock variable contains the core clock , it can
 308:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *         be used by the user application to setup the SysTick timer or configure
 309:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *         other parameters.
 310:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *
 311:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   * @note   Each time the core clock changes, this function must be called
 312:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *         to update SystemCoreClock variable value. Otherwise, any configuration
 313:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *         based on this variable will be incorrect.
 314:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *
 315:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   * @note   - The system frequency computed by this function is not the real
 316:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *           frequency in the chip. It is calculated based on the predefined
 317:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *           constant and the selected clock source:
 318:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *
 319:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *           - If SYSCLK source is CSI, SystemCoreClock will contain the CSI_VALUE(*)
 320:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *           - If SYSCLK source is HSI, SystemCoreClock will contain the HSI_VALUE(**)
 321:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *           - If SYSCLK source is HSE, SystemCoreClock will contain the HSE_VALUE(***)
 322:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *           - If SYSCLK source is PLL, SystemCoreClock will contain the CSI_VALUE(*),
 323:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *             HSI_VALUE(**) or HSE_VALUE(***) multiplied/divided by the PLL factors.
 324:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *
 325:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *         (*) CSI_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32h7xx_hal.h file (default value
 326:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *             4 MHz) but the real value may vary depending on the variations
 327:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *             in voltage and temperature.
 328:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *         (**) HSI_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32h7xx_hal.h file (default value
ARM GAS  C:\Users\nicx5\AppData\Local\Temp\cczGl65N.s 			page 10


 329:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *             64 MHz) but the real value may vary depending on the variations
 330:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *             in voltage and temperature.
 331:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *
 332:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *         (***)HSE_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32h7xx_hal.h file (default value
 333:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *              25 MHz), user has to ensure that HSE_VALUE is same as the real
 334:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *              frequency of the crystal used. Otherwise, this function may
 335:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *              have wrong result.
 336:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *
 337:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *         - The result of this function could be not correct when using fractional
 338:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   *           value for HSE crystal.
 339:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   * @param  None
 340:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   * @retval None
 341:Core/Src/system_stm32h7xx.c ****   */
